    "Create Storm and Spark Streaming example modules under Spring XD samples.",
    "Port Smart Grid demo from s1-2014 into the Spring XD samples repository.",
    "Implement JDBC to HDFS data movement using Spring Batch and Sqoop.",
    "Add --nameExpression option to file sink for flexible filename generation."
